              "stage_id": "I/uhCFdGvxrPxCb7Wf3BXg==",
              "title": "doinewdjfnewjdewnjwenc",
              "description": "Anuj Shukla\u00a0\u00a0[1:38 PM]\nNew post composer is live\n\nThe one-off post composer has a new look (ticket 1221, PR: https://github.com/dinwal/recurpost/pull/3563). It is merged and live on social.recurpost.com. A 4-minute walkthrough video is attached.\n\nWhat changed\n\u2022 Three panels: Where to post, the compose panel and How it looks, all on one screen.\n\u2022 Live previews: every picked network, in web or phone size. The same preview opens from Queue, History, Calendar and Library.\n\u2022 Clear errors: Post now checks every network first and lists what is missing in one popup.\n\u2022 Publish result dialog: after Post now or Schedule, it shows what happened profile by profile.\n\u2022 Send again: for Facebook profiles, groups and Instagram personal, the phone notification can be sent again from the result dialog, and from History > Social profile details.\n\u2022 No app on the phone: the result says \u201cInstall the app to post\u201d, with App Store and Google Play links.\n\u2022 Instagram DM automation: the composer now asks \u201cWhat triggers it?\u201d first: Specific keywords or Any comment. The same section is there when editing or retrying a post.\n\u2022 Closing with unsaved work: asks whether to Discard, Save as draft or Keep editing.\n\u2022 Also updated: X thread builder, library composers, Drafts and Kanban.\n\nNot in this release: DM automation for library posts. It will ship separately.\n\nPlease try it and reply in this thread if anything looks off.",
